# Engineering Technology Education Bibliography, 1990.

**Authors:** Dyrud, Marilyn A.

## Abstract
Lists over 340 materials published in 1990 related to engineering technology education and grouped under the following headings: administration; architectural; computer-assisted design/management (CAD/CAM); civil; computers; curriculum; electrical/electronics; industrial; industry/government/employers; instructional technology; laboratories; lasers; liberal studies; manufacturing; mechanical; minorities; research; robotics; surveying; teaching methodology; technical writing; and telecommunications. (JJK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ449272

